OL,3,GNEWSAYellow wind warning for millions
OL,4,Ain UK as Storm Austen sees thousands
OL,5,Alose power in South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,8,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,9,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,11,FEngland
OL,13,FAn amber wind warning will kick in from
OL,14,F21:00 tomorrow until Sunday evening
OL,15,Facross much of Scotland, parts of
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland as well as northern
OL,17,FEngland
